  "prefLabel": "Lot 8104.03 Problem Gambling and Self-Exclusion",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 8104.03 Problem Gambling and Self-Exclusion. Each ADW provider shall post and make readily available to its account holders a copy of its responsible gaming plan, which shall include:\n\n(a) Materials related to problem gaming, including resources available to individuals or account holders expressing concerns about problem gaming;\n\n(b) Information relative to a player’s ability to set limits for deposit and wagering; and\n\n(c) Options available for individuals or account holders to self-exclude from wagering.\n\nSource. #14448, eff 12-3-25, EXPIRES: 12-3-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot8100.html"
